    "updated_at": "2026-09-13T23:11:55Z",
    "body": "Please come back to this, it'd be such a great feature!\r\n\r\nIf anyone else is desperate for Little Zen, I tried to make an extension that's a decent alternative. It's just not a global shortcut. It works fine enough for me, but the moment Little Zen comes, I will switch: https://github.com/alejandrovegab/QuickSearch-Extension (does not have a global shortcut).\r\n\r\nI don't know if posting our own stuff is banned, so if it is, I will promptly delete it.\r\n\r\nPlease come back to Little Zen, but thank you nonetheless for your work on Zen!",
